            "review_text": "msmusicagent\nLos Angeles, California41 contributions\n0\nDysfunctional\nJan 2025 • Solo\nI decided to give this bakery/cafe a try because it looked interesting. It has dozens of pastries that are sitting on an open shelf. \n\nI ordered a hot Matcha Latte and 2 issues came up. First they forgot my order and then they brought me a cold drink. \n\nThe second issue is that they store the matcha on top of the espresso machine when it should be refrigerated every time it’s not being needed. Matcha is expensive and can easily degrade in warm temperatures.\nRead more\nWritten January 14, 2025",
